    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/76/Vulko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230306141415\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Vulko Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/76/Vulko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230306141415\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"918\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Vulko Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Vulko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eHalf Blood Exorcist\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA young hunter of demonic creatures. She lives in an old castle and protects people from demonic creatures in secret, but she herself is half-vampire and half-werewolf. No one knows why she hunts the creatures she shares her nature with.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821132338\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n--\u003e\n\u003c!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n--\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39613-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821132338 and revisi